  "name": null,
  "problem": "A company manufactures electronic components. The components are produced by three machines, $A,$ $B,$ and $C.$ In a particular random sample, $31$ of the components were produced by machine $A,$ $34$ by machine $B,$ and $35$ by machine $C.$ On inspecting the sample for defective components, it was found that $2$ defective components were produced by machine $A,$ $1$  by machine $B,$ and $2$  by machine $C.$ Based on this data, what is the probability that a randomly selected component from the sample is defective?",
